{"version":1,"content":"<p>已故蘇格蘭男星辛康納利（Sean Connery）是首位飾演「占士邦」的演員，而他共演過7次。</p><p>不過根據第3任「占士邦」已故男星羅渣摩亞（Roger Moore）的演員兒子Geoffrey Moore表示原本父親才是監製首任「占士邦」的首選。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:21:50.410684+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:01:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.983942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.983942+00:00","content_hash":"5b7198c8b8f0fce02deccbd2a27c87d0fc97eea58761dbd1109237b088615194","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}